.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH UNLINK 1 "2026-09-01"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
unlink \- Unlink the file at FILE.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBunlink\fR FILE
.br
\fBunlink\fR OPTION
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Unlink the file at FILE.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v(uutils coreutils) 0.11.0
